<VI _name="Build Win32 Wrappers.vi" description="Creates or overwrites the two thin user32.dll wrapper VIs of the RemoteVI toolkit by VI scripting\3A source\5CWin32\5Cuser32 PostMessageW.vi and source\5CWin32\5Cuser32 ScreenToClient.vi. Each one starts as a copy of its template in scripts\5CWin32 Wrapper Templates (front panel\2C connector pane\2C icon\2C descriptions)\2C then gets a Call Library Function Node placed\2C configured (user32.dll\2C stdcall\2C run in any thread\2C typed parameters) and wired by VI Server - the one node AIXML cannot author. Each wrapper is spelled as text (see W32B Parse Spec.vi for the line format). Run it from the IDE whenever a template or a spec changes. Paths are found relative to this VI\2C so the repository may live anywhere.">
  <Control _name="error in" type="cluster{bool.status,int32.code,string.source}" uid="errin" uid_parent="root" value="[false,0,]" conIdx="8" connection="recommended" description="Nothing is built when this carries an error." outputs="value:errin.value" />
